  guideTitle: "How to Put a Rug on Carpet Without It Creeping",
  metaTitle: "How to Put a Rug on Carpet",
  metaDescription: "Stop rug creep on carpet with the right pad, contrast pile heights, sensible sizes and a low pile over high pile layout that stays flat and trip-free.",
  heroImage: "/images/articles/rug-on-carpet-hero.webp",
